<title>ITALY: Italian futures hold on to gains by close but weak.</title>
<headline>Italian futures hold on to gains by close but weak.</headline>
<text>
<p>1610 - Italian bonds and futures held on to a modest rise by the close but market seen weak and sentiment nervous with operators watching lira hovering around 1,000 per mark level.</p>
<p>* Bonds:Nov06 +26bps at 102.75, yield 7.49, spread 194 bps</p>
<p>* Futures:MarLIF +50bps at 128.00. Res 128.20, sup 127.50</p>
<p>* Lira:1,000.15/0.40 vs session low at 1,003.60</p>
</text>
